# handle-drag-release (h7-plane): the shift drag settled (wait 300 lets the
# renders and the debounce catch up, so the handle sits exactly under the
# pointer), a 1 px nudge re-hits deterministically, then up: the URL holds
# h=2.02&k=-3.6, the modes are cleared, the cursor is grab-hover with h,k lit.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1028 670 over 160
wait 300
move 1029 670
up
wait 600
shot handle-drag-release
